    "attributes": {
        "action": "Restrict the use of generative AI to healthcare professionals",
        "additional_details": "I believe generative AI is rapidly increasing climate change, is detrimental to the environment, and that it should only be used for things such as detecting cancer, as it can detect cancers earlier than most machines can. We need to restrict access to generative AI to help our planet and give our future children a chance at a good life.",
        "background": "Pass a law that limits generative AI use to healthcare professionals, to help detect cancer earlier for example. I believe generative AI in society is ruining the planet as well as people\u2019s mental health and social skills.",
